Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Unicorn PPC: theoretically complete backend + first smoke
 test
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implement full KPX-parity runtime on Unicorn: interrupt(entry), 60 Hz tick
thread, execute_fast/ppc/68k/68k_trap, trigger_interrupt, and EmulOp /
EXEC_NATIVE / EXEC_RETURN dispatch through major-opcode-6 (helper_mac_emulop
via translate.c). Auto-maps zero pages on unmapped reads/writes to mimic
KPX's SIGSEGV-skip on nanokernel memory probes, and bails execute_fast out
of repeated stuck-PC errors. ROM region mapped RW+X so nanokernel can patch
in place. Boot reaches 0x50313fc8 before diverging — debug phase next.
